@DohFlo_HostAddress = https://localhost:44323

### Get every account
GET {{DohFlo_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Get one account
GET {{DohFlo_HostAddrss}}/api/accounts/1
Acept : application/json

### Create an account
POST {{DohFlo_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json 

{
  "name": "Vacation Savings",
  "type": "Savings",
  "institution": "Example Bank",
  "CurrencyCode": "USD"
}

### Update account 1
PUT {{DohFlo_HostAddress}}/ap/accounts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"Primary Checking",
  "type": "Checking",
  "institution": "Example Bank",
  "currencyCode": "USD"
}

### Close account 1
PATCH {{DohFlo_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/1/status
Content-Type: application/json 

{
  "isClosed": true
}

### Prove that validation returns 400
POST {{DohFlo_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "type": "Banana",
  "institution": "",
  "currencyCode": "US"
}